{"id":63536,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=63536"},"modified":"2026-10-19T15:58:33","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T14:58:33","slug":"sao-silvestre-cortegaca-esmoriz","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-cortegaca-esmoriz\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Cortega\u00e7a\/Esmoriz 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Cortega\u00e7a\/Esmoriz 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Cortega\u00e7a\/Esmoriz 2026<\/strong> (5\u00aa Corrida S. Silvestre Esmoriz \u00b7 Cortega\u00e7a) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com zona de partida e meta instalada em <strong>Esmoriz<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Ovar<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>). Organizada pela <strong>Academia de Boxe Victor S\u00e1<\/strong> com o apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Ovar, das Juntas de Freguesia de Esmoriz e de Cortega\u00e7a e arbitragem da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro, a prova celebra a sua 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o ao final da tarde.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo arranca \u00e0s <strong>16:30<\/strong> com a <strong>Corrida Pequenada de 400 m<\/strong> (destinada a crian\u00e7as at\u00e9 aos 11 anos, mediante entrega solid\u00e1ria de um bem alimentar n\u00e3o perec\u00edvel), seguida \u00e0s <strong>17:00<\/strong> pela <strong>Corrida de 5 km<\/strong> (cronometrada, com tempo limite de 35 minutos) e \u00e0s <strong>17:45<\/strong> pela prova rainha de <strong>10 km<\/strong> e pela <strong>Caminhada de 4,5 km<\/strong>. Como novidade de destaque, o <strong>Desafio Duplo 10+5 km<\/strong> permite correr os 5 km \u00e0s 17:00 e os 10 km \u00e0s 17:45 com o mesmo dorsal e medalha exclusiva.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es nas provas competitivas incluem dorsal com chip, saco mochila, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, abastecimentos e a medalha oficial de 2026 (em formato de boneco de gengibre com bengala doce). Na prova principal de 10 km s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina (150 \u20ac, 100 \u20ac e 60 \u20ac), bem como trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o de veteranos (M\/F 40 a M\/F 60+). Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Esmoriz, Ovar, Aveiro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: u